OL,3,GNEWSACardiac arrest survivor back
OL,4,Aplaying pickleball
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who suffered a cardiac arrest
OL,7,Fwhile playing pickleball has returned
OL,8,Fto the sport three months on.
OL,10,FMartin Paxton collapsed while playing a
OL,11,Fleague match at Guernsey Table Tennis
OL,12,FCentre in June 2026.
OL,14,FIt took 18 minutes, two injections and
OL,15,Fthree defibrillator shocks to restart
OL,16,Fhis heart, according to those who
OL,17,Fhelped save him.
OL,19,F"I was gone, so no heartbeat and no
OL,20,Fbreathing, that was it, I was literally
OL,21,Fdead," he said.
